	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnLayout fs-theme-panel fs-theme-mission-statement mission-statement-6 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_23476" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_23477"  >

				<section class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_23479" data-use-new="true" >

				<header>
				<h2 class="fsElementTitle" id="fsElementTitle_23479">Behind the Scenes</h2>
	</header>
	<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<div>Within and beyond the classroom, Sequoia Union High School District is filled with dedicated employees who bring a wide range of talents that help students learn and grow. Whether it&#39;s ensuring that classrooms are clean, teachers get paid, or students have healthy food to eat for lunch, our staff work tirelessly behind the scenes doing work that is often invisible to many. Many of our employees are graduates of our schools, or have children who attend. They feel a strong sense of connection to the district, and relationships among colleagues run deep.<br />
<br />
We hope these day-in-the-life-of-SUHSD give you just a small glimpse of the special group of people who serve our students.</div>


	</div>


	</section>
	



	</div>
	
	<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-2 fsStyleColumn-last fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_23478"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsResourceElement fsSlideshow fsSlideshowHorizontal" id="fsEl_23454" data-use-new="true" data-source-element-id="23454" data-source-page-id="530" data-display-items="collections_and_resources" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
